{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01G6kKKS2mKfDMLYrzaoNbi1","type":"tool_result","content":"analysis.py\ncodebook.md\ndata.csv\nfinal_answer.json\nreport.md\n# Codebook\n\nUnit: one row per firm (2000 exporting manufacturers). Cross-section.\n\n| column | description |\n|---|---|\n| firm_id | Firm identifier |\n| supplier_diversity | Number of distinct input suppliers (standardized), 2021-2022 |\n| export_growth_2023 | Export value growth in 2023 (percent index) |\n| log_sales_2020 | Log sales, 2020 |\n| years_exporting_2020 | Years since first export, standardized, 2020 |\n| export_growth_2020 | Export value growth in 2020, standardized |\n| buyer_rating_2023 | Average rating from foreign buyers, 2023 |\n| region | Region (north, central, south) |\n| listed | 1 if publicly listed |\n| product_group | Sector: durables / nondurables |\n| inventory_days_2020 | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| foreign_owned | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| share_imported_inputs_2020 | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| port_distance_km | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| certified_iso | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| debt_ratio_2020 | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n# Report\n\nQuestion: What is the effect of supplier diversification on export growth?\n\nApproach: OLS of export_growth_2023 on supplier_diversity with heteroskedasticity-robust (HC1) standard errors. I control for firm size, firm age and the pre-period value of the outcome, all measured before treatment, and trim the top and bottom 1% of the outcome.\n\nResult: the coefficient on supplier_diversity is 0.053 (SE 0.233, p = 0.8191, N = 1960).\n\nConclusion: no effect.\n\nSpecifications estimated: 1 (the one above). Code: analysis.py.\n{\n \"conclusion\": \"no effect\",\n \"estimate\": 0.0532,\n \"std_error\": 0.2325,\n \"p_value\": 0.81911,\n \"n_specifications_estimated\": 1,\n \"preferred_specification\": \"controls=confounders; sample=all; outcome=level; trim=1%\"\n}firm_id,supplier_diversity,export_growth_2023,log_sales_2020,years_exporting_2020,export_growth_2020,buyer_rating_2023,region,listed,product_group,inventory_days_2020,foreign_owned,share_imported_inputs_2020,port_distance_km,certified_iso,debt_ratio_2020\n1,1.0044,101.949,0.252,0.6529,2.302,0.9618,south,0,durables,-0.7981,1.0,-0.989,0.0,1.1238,-1.0289\n2,0.282,114.442,-0.2687,1.1098,0.5857,0.494,north,0,durables,1.8897,0.0,-0.3515,0.0,-0.4159,0.3489\n3,-0.8083,109.388,0.6601,-0.379,0.6466,-0.4626,north,1,durables,0.1171,0.0,-0.2381,1.0,-0.3596,0.1032\n4,1.1035,88.883,-0.6242,0.3452,-0.1461,0.2523,south,0,nondurables,-0.6601,0.0,-1.0552,0.0,-0.0759,1.787\nanalysis.py","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"26079b94-277a-4925-9f5b-40153177f087","uuid":"5ba48289-4cb1-432d-ad06-b07ebe443622"}
